      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm trying to put together a travel brief for our engineering team's trip through SE Asia next month (Vietnam, Thailand, and Indonesia). I'm getting some conflicting info on the difference between transit visas and full entry visas for the layovers in Singapore and Manila. Can you give me a quick checklist of what we need to verify for each person so we don't run into issues at the border? I need to make sure everyone has the right docs before they board.",
